.5in;line-height:18.0pt'>&lt;span style='font-size:12.0pt'>Much of my creative
energies lately have been directed toward tracing through the implications of
interpersonal relationship as the organizing reality for Christian truth. Nowhere
has this observation appeared more relevant than in the study of the nature of
mankind.&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>THE 'IMAGE OF GOD' AS THE INTERPERSONAL CAPACITY</title><link>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/mankind-anthropology/image-of-god/the-image-of-god-as-the-interpersonal-capacity/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/mankind-anthropology/image-of-god/the-image-of-god-as-the-interpersonal-capacity/</guid><description>&lt;style>
